{"4296220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trailer Game", "steam_appid": 4296220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse a trailer through a course made up of five distinct areas that get progressively more challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/7bac850139a507e295258cb7be0c55e5.poster.avif?t=1775291897\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/7bac850139a507e295258cb7be0c55e5.webm?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/7bac850139a507e295258cb7be0c55e5.mp4?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One step forward, two steps back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving forward causes the pickup truck to start smoking and eventually explode. The damage is fixed by reversing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/6c7e3dc16855de9f64a566c934ea9d58.poster.avif?t=1775291897\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/6c7e3dc16855de9f64a566c934ea9d58.webm?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/6c7e3dc16855de9f64a566c934ea9d58.mp4?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For an additional challenge, collect all eight boxes hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/a3507eb192fe784b30cb127cc1023fe7.poster.avif?t=1775291897\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/a3507eb192fe784b30cb127cc1023fe7.webm?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/a3507eb192fe784b30cb127cc1023fe7.mp4?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Game Plus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the base game, a new game can be started with any (or multiple) of these game changing mechanics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm wagon:</strong> A type of trailer that is even more difficult to reverse due to a steerable axle  <br>(warning: the devs are genuinely not sure if this is even possible)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Trailer:</strong> See just how much the trailer adds to the difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double or triple speed:</strong> Fail fast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low gravity:</strong> Turns out gravity is needed for traction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three second input delay:</strong> Are you able to think three seconds ahead?</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reverse a trailer through a course made up of five distinct areas that get progressively more challenging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/7bac850139a507e295258cb7be0c55e5.poster.avif?t=1775291897\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/7bac850139a507e295258cb7be0c55e5.webm?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/7bac850139a507e295258cb7be0c55e5.mp4?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One step forward, two steps back</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving forward causes the pickup truck to start smoking and eventually explode. The damage is fixed by reversing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/6c7e3dc16855de9f64a566c934ea9d58.poster.avif?t=1775291897\" width=1170 height=490 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/6c7e3dc16855de9f64a566c934ea9d58.webm?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/6c7e3dc16855de9f64a566c934ea9d58.mp4?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For an additional challenge, collect all eight boxes hidden throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/a3507eb192fe784b30cb127cc1023fe7.poster.avif?t=1775291897\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/a3507eb192fe784b30cb127cc1023fe7.webm?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/extras/a3507eb192fe784b30cb127cc1023fe7.mp4?t=1775291897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Game Plus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After completing the base game, a new game can be started with any (or multiple) of these game changing mechanics</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm wagon:</strong> A type of trailer that is even more difficult to reverse due to a steerable axle  <br>(warning: the devs are genuinely not sure if this is even possible)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Trailer:</strong> See just how much the trailer adds to the difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double or triple speed:</strong> Fail fast</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low gravity:</strong> Turns out gravity is needed for traction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three second input delay:</strong> Are you able to think three seconds ahead?</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Reversing a trailer is tough in real life, this game takes the challenge to the extreme. Traverse tight corners, uneven terrain and narrow bridges in this ultimate test of skill and determination.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/de81e54595ae2640ce9710dab6d01029ef1c2b93/header.jpg?t=1775291897", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/1aacde53e5feaa453091b07a6cbcca6af0514b74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775291897", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4296220/1aacde53e5feaa453091b07a6cbcca6af0514b74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775291897", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memo